Hi! The CI currently shows skipped jobs because this repo requires the `run-ci` label to trigger the full test suite. The failing jobs you see are just the CI gating placeholders (`call-gate/pr-gate`, `pr-test-*-finish`) — real tests haven't run yet.

Could someone please add the `run-ci` label to kick off the actual test matrix? Thanks so much! 🙏

@lm-sys @zhyncs @hnyls2002 @ispobock @BBuf @Fridge003 @kevin-mii

